{"items":[{"key":"article:31133703","id":"31133703","kind":"article","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1631967531282,"text":"","title":"【四格】一定不止阿望这么干过","images":["263e5fd27764525cb3fff171"],"cover":"","duration":"","views":32162,"counts":{"commentCount":119,"likeCount":0,"bananaCount":16297,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/a/ac31133703","hotComment":{"id":"502513361","user":{"id":"2875","name":"竹剥侍居","avatar":"2039796ecfa2f84620ecf0de"},"text":"有一黑皮小孩前来买瓜。\r\n老奶奶的老伴：[emot=acfun,1684/]哎，生异形吗老婆你这。\r\n黑皮小孩阿望：[emot=acfun,1689/]奶奶，你这瓜多少钱一斤啊？\r\n老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1688/]两块钱一斤。\r\n阿望：[emot=acfun,1705/]what&#39;s up，奶奶你这瓜皮是金子做的还是瓜子是金子做的。\r\n老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1691/]这都是大棚的瓜，你嫌贵我还嫌贵呢。\r\n阿望：[emot=acfun,1703/]给我挑一个。\r\n老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1678/]行。（转头）\r\n【于是阿望趁老奶奶不注意，在电光火石之际，一把抢过了蒲扇。】\r\n老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1685/]哎你这瓜皮娃儿，找茬的是不是！\r\n迅速把蒲扇插在背后的阿望：[emot=acfun,1727/]萨日朗~萨日朗~（边唱边跳）\r\n某位拼命用双手挤着胸前的不愿透露姓名的水某：[emot=acfun,1725/]阿望，哎阿望。\r\n【最后水某把阿望带到老奶奶瓜摊并把蒲扇物归原主，皆大欢喜】","images":[],"likes":69}}],"media":{"2039796ecfa2f84620ecf0de":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/2875_711e1e7b70c44840813e99172cea417b.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/WVUIGoYCnD-NBniqm-B3m6ry-ziMzEr-UzuQbq.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/2875_711e1e7b70c44840813e99172cea417b.png"]},"263e5fd27764525cb3fff171":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/SFRyjz5hd3-6FZJbu-UNNZjq-mEvAfi-YJnUJz.png?imageslim","fallbacks":[]},"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EKvK1y8qOwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGisxNzk5MjJfZDFmM2U0NTUzODAzNDZhMGJkZDNlYmVjNWIxMjk5NmYucG5n.webp","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/EKvK1y8qOwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGisxNzk5MjJfZDFmM2U0NTUzODAzNDZhMGJkZDNlYmVjNWIxMjk5NmYucG5n.webp"]}},"emotions":{"acfun,1678":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/1678_f532afe4f02740c0ac357d